  "_layers": "hands: relaxed replaces the library's loose fists with a natural rest curl carried by the hand (clip_retarget.RelaxedHands). stance: two-bone leg IK toward a target ankle spacing with the knees turned forward (clip_retarget.Stance); the library idle is a wide combat-ready stance.",
  "_idle_swords": "MM_Idle_Swords: the drawn-blades ready stance (UAL Sword_Idle, hands gripping the hilts; no relaxed hands). The game's Idle state switches to it while the blades are out.",
  "_transitions": "Jog starts and stops composed from this profile's own jog and idle (scripts/anim/transition_clips.py), on the game's movement curves: The Aether Wars ATheAetherWarsCharacter MaxAcceleration 1400, BrakingDecelerationWalking 1000, BrakingFriction 0.5 x factor 2. Stop_L/Stop_R plant the left/right foot first; the game picks the one already planted. Pivot_L/Pivot_R: 180-degree reversal at the jog turning left/right (inside foot planted); reverse_friction = 2 x GroundFriction 8, yaw 720 deg/s (RotationRate).",
  "_dodges": "MM_Dodge_Fwd: UAL 2 Sword_Dash_RM in place (the game moves the capsule), retimed so the lunge lands in the game's 0.34 s dodge (source 0.3 s -> 0.1 s, 1.0 s -> 0.34 s, end 1.57 s -> 0.62 s). MM_Dodge_Back: no open library has an evasive back-hop, so transition_clips.build_backhop keys one on the drawn-blades idle."
